 on there  that's exactly right and i keep going  back to kenneth walker i woke up  thinking about him this morning because  he was in jail he couldn't go to the  funeral because he had been charged with  attempted murder so he feels  he never of the police officer he never  got a chance to say goodbye and he said  that's also part of the pain that he's  dealing with there's still so much more  to this story  we will share more of our exclusive  interview that we have with kenneth  walker  during a one-hour special on b-e-t it's  called  say her name the untold story of brianna  taylor you can watch it saturday at six  o'clock eastern  on b-e-t which by the way is a division  of viacom cbs  we'll be right back

